    {
      "heading": "Estar for a subjective impression",
      "body": "*Estar* with an adjective that normally uses *ser* expresses how something seems now or a change: *¡Qué alta estás!* (How tall you've gotten!) *La sopa está salada.* (The soup is (tastes) salty.) *Estás muy linda hoy.* (You look very pretty today.)"
    }
